Rationale: Per-point birth/death intervals are an added geometry contract spanning custom intersections, Embree and OptiX ray time; upstream has no matching lifetime socket in this pin.
Contract: Add per-point existence intervals to CPU/custom GPU intersections and Embree filters. Read stationary OptiX ray time from the original Cycles ray payload.
Tests: tests/core_point_lifetime_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

